<title>SWITZERLAND: Adecco details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Adecco details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net, proforma	  241		 vs 206</p>
<p>Net loss</p>
<p>  after extraordinaries     11.1		vs N/A</p>
<p> Div (Sfr)			five		vs N/A</p>
<p> Revenues			 8,524	     vs 7,608</p>
<p>Revenues as per</p>
<p>  U.S. GAAP		     6,386	     vs N/A</p>
<p> Earnings per share (Sfr)   14.6		vs 12.36</p>
<p> Operating income	     388		 vs 356</p>
<p>NOTE - Adecco SA was formed last year from merger of Adia SA and Ecco SA. Adecco said in a statement that the figures for revenues, operating income, net income before goodwill and earnings per sharewere were presented as if the merger had happened at the begining of 1995. They exclude the results of businesses sold during 1996 and 1995. The proforma information also excludes merger related costs, one-time gains arising from disposal of investments and amortisation expenses.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7450</p>
